# Agents loop

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for every user-requested change.

- Full loop: plan → user proceeds → orchestrator → implementer → reviewer → SUCCESS or FAIL-reprompt. Do not skip steps or invent a side path.
- Orchestrator is read-only for edits; only implementers write. Doubts escalate orchestrator → user.
- KISS. No hallucinations, unproven theories, or AI slop. No out-of-scope work without user approval.
- Manual start/resume: project skill `loop-in-devs`.
